==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|NL.|sensōrius}} (compare {{cog|LL.|sensōrium}}), from {{der|en|la|sēnsus||feeling, sense}}, from {{m|la|sentiō||feel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsɛnsəɹi/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of the [[sense]]s or [[sensation]].

====Usage notes====
Prefix combining form is ''sensori-'', as in {{m|en|sensorimotor}}.

